WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:19.750
This pandemic has really changed everything...

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:20.916
-But not for us!

00:00:20.916 --> 00:00:23.541
We built a big dome over the f--king mansion!

00:00:23.541 --> 00:00:26.500
What happens when 800 of the world's most elite footballers

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:29.791
and their managers live together under one roof?

00:00:29.791 --> 00:00:31.291
Players stop being polite

00:00:31.291 --> 00:00:33.416
and start getting Re-al.

00:00:33.416 --> 00:00:34.416
This is

00:00:34.416 --> 00:00:35.125
The Champions.

00:00:35.125 --> 00:00:38.125
-They say form is temporary and class is permanent.

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:41.875
I hope they’re right, because my form has been...not good.

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:44.625
-Sometimes I like to pretend I’m Cinderella.

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:47.375
It fits!

00:00:47.875 --> 00:00:50.416
-Terrible things are happening at Barcelona right now.

00:00:50.416 --> 00:00:52.125
You hate to see it.

00:00:52.125 --> 00:00:54.750
Me? I love to see it.

00:00:55.916 --> 00:00:58.500
-Hi. I hope this message finds you well.

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:02.166
Just a gentle reminder that I still exist and would like a job.

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:21.875
-So far, life in The Dome is pretty good.

00:01:21.875 --> 00:01:25.375
Every day, us cool, young bros make crazy pool parties,

00:01:25.375 --> 00:01:28.541
the Farmers’ League is teaching us to grow our own food.

00:01:28.541 --> 00:01:31.250
and anything else we need is delivered by drone!

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:32.791
[Shouting]

00:01:32.791 --> 00:01:34.166
-Give it to Kevin!

00:01:34.166 --> 00:01:36.166
[Shouting]

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:42.416
[Shouting]

00:01:42.416 --> 00:01:44.750
-Oh, no! My scrunchies were in there!

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:45.875
-Our toothpaste!
-Our toothpaste!

00:01:45.875 --> 00:01:47.500
-My brass knuckles polish!

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:49.250
-Whoa, whoa! What's the problem, lads?

00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:50.541
-Allow me to interpret.

00:01:50.541 --> 00:01:53.000
Our delivery box has crashed into the cornfield.

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:55.125
Now we are all without our luxury items.

00:01:55.125 --> 00:01:58.041
And as a direct result, people are losing their s--t!

00:01:58.041 --> 00:02:01.041
-A high-stakes rescue mission? That is O.F.T.

00:02:01.041 --> 00:02:02.666
Opportunity for TikTok.

00:02:02.666 --> 00:02:04.541
C'mon, bro, you're always on TikTok.

00:02:04.541 --> 00:02:06.166
Cos I'm the king of TikTok.

00:02:06.166 --> 00:02:07.166
[Groans]

00:02:07.166 --> 00:02:08.000
[Cheers]

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:09.250
Don’t worry, guys.

00:02:09.250 --> 00:02:11.041
The Champions will handle this.

00:02:11.041 --> 00:02:14.625
[Chants]
-Eins, zwei, drei, Search Party!

00:02:14.625 --> 00:02:15.791
-Let's do this for Canada,

00:02:15.791 --> 00:02:16.291
I mean Drake,

00:02:16.291 --> 00:02:19.375
I mean Germany.
-Hey, don't forget your fifth wheel, my dudes!

00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:25.875
-It's not that we don't like Lewandowski.

00:02:25.875 --> 00:02:27.625
I mean, on the pitch, he’s amazing.

00:02:27.625 --> 00:02:28.625
But off the pitch?

00:02:29.625 --> 00:02:33.000
Can't he just hang out with players his own age?

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:34.500
-Isn't this so lit?

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:38.125
Just a bunch of cool, young dudes having a cornfield and chill?

00:02:38.125 --> 00:02:40.125
Hey, guys, what am I?!

00:02:40.125 --> 00:02:40.916
What am I?

00:02:41.625 --> 00:02:42.791
I'm a Pole dance!

00:02:42.791 --> 00:02:46.000
[Grunts]

00:02:49.250 --> 00:02:52.500
[Chuckles]

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:54.125
You get it? Pole dance...

00:02:54.125 --> 00:02:56.000
Because I'm Polish.

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:57.375
-Yeah! We get it!

00:02:57.375 --> 00:02:59.166
-Yo! Trill out, man!

00:02:59.166 --> 00:02:59.875
-OK!

00:02:59.875 --> 00:03:01.750
Everybody calm down.

00:03:01.750 --> 00:03:02.625
You calm down!

00:03:02.625 --> 00:03:05.541
Both of you Alphonsos need to back off, right now!

00:03:05.541 --> 00:03:06.500
-Uh

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:07.500
hey, guys?

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:09.375
I think I found the box.

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:11.250
-Oh, s--t! We did it!

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:13.500
C'mon, guys, let's celebrate with a TikTok.

00:03:14.416 --> 00:03:15.166
What's up, y'all?

00:03:15.166 --> 00:03:17.750
We just did a search and rescue for this delivery box.

00:03:17.750 --> 00:03:19.125
Cos if you want a job done,

00:03:19.125 --> 00:03:20.125
you send in the Champions.

00:03:20.125 --> 00:03:22.791
[Cheers]

00:03:22.791 --> 00:03:24.500
-We will never die!

00:03:26.166 --> 00:03:28.750
-What is wrong with you?!

00:03:28.750 --> 00:03:30.416
-Yo, my phone won't turn on.

00:03:30.416 --> 00:03:31.541
Mine either.

00:03:31.541 --> 00:03:33.416
-Sacre bleu!

00:03:33.416 --> 00:03:35.000
How are we to get home without our phones?

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:36.750
-What is your deal, dummkopf?

00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:38.291
Why would you blast us with Champagne?

00:03:38.291 --> 00:03:41.000
-Why did you even come along?

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:43.166
-It's time to face the facts.

00:03:43.166 --> 00:03:45.916
I may only be 32 years young,

00:03:45.916 --> 00:03:49.250
but I am also 32 years old.

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:53.875
Sorry, guys. I now realize I was being mad extra.

00:03:53.875 --> 00:03:56.916
From now on, I’ll just be normal Robert.

00:03:58.166 --> 00:03:59.750
Let's get you boys home.

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:13.916
Ah. Yes, that is poop.

00:04:17.166 --> 00:04:18.375
Oh, look! We made it!

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:20.791
Or rather, I finished for you guys.

00:04:20.791 --> 00:04:22.625
-Whoa! You did it!

00:04:22.625 --> 00:04:24.166
How did you know to do all that stuff?

00:04:24.166 --> 00:04:26.666
-This is how we got around in my day.

00:04:26.666 --> 00:04:28.416
Before smartphones and Fitbits.

00:04:28.416 --> 00:04:29.416
[Gasps]

00:04:29.416 --> 00:04:31.041
-The ancient times.

00:04:31.375 --> 00:04:32.916
-Man, old people are cool.

00:04:33.125 --> 00:04:34.291
For once, we agree.

00:04:34.291 --> 00:04:35.541
[Chuckles]

00:04:35.541 --> 00:04:36.250
[Groans]

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:45.875
[Shouting]

00:04:45.875 --> 00:04:47.041
-Seriously?

00:04:47.041 --> 00:04:48.750
We’ve been gone 90 minutes.

00:04:56.708 --> 00:04:59.833
What happens when 800 of the world's most elite footballers

00:04:59.833 --> 00:05:02.708
and their managers live together under one roof?

00:05:02.708 --> 00:05:04.333
Players stop being polite

00:05:04.333 --> 00:05:06.583
and start getting Re-al.

00:05:06.583 --> 00:05:07.333
This is

00:05:07.333 --> 00:05:08.583
The Champions.

00:05:08.583 --> 00:05:11.958
I’m so excited to make a big difference at Bayern…

00:05:11.958 --> 00:05:15.208
maybe this season we can beat Barca 9-2.

00:05:15.208 --> 00:05:19.208
-It took a bribery scandal to get Harry Maguire on the front page.

00:05:19.208 --> 00:05:21.333
Me? All it took was a haircut.

00:05:21.333 --> 00:05:25.708
-I never cheated on my Italian citizenship test.

00:05:25.708 --> 00:05:27.083
PRODUCER: Are you reading that off a paper?

00:05:27.083 --> 00:05:28.083
-No!

00:05:37.833 --> 00:05:43.208
-(Grunts)

00:05:43.208 --> 00:05:44.708
-Well, that's a bit odd.

00:05:44.958 --> 00:05:47.958
-Everyone's been curious about my incredible man management

00:05:47.958 --> 00:05:48.958
of Christian Pulisic.

00:05:48.958 --> 00:05:52.083
Well, I kind of told him a lie...

00:05:52.083 --> 00:05:57.208
as a form of motivation! Haha but no, I'm definitely manipulating him.

00:05:57.208 --> 00:06:02.333
Ok, ok...I told Christian if he played really well this season

00:06:02.333 --> 00:06:05.708
I could maybe get him a job in the Queen's Secret Service.

00:06:05.708 --> 00:06:07.458
-What?! Why would you do this?

00:06:10.083 --> 00:06:12.208
-Beg your pardon. Forgot to knock.

00:06:12.708 --> 00:06:15.458
Being a secret agent is totally awesome.

00:06:15.458 --> 00:06:19.083
I get to do one-liners and climb around in the air vent, plus,

00:06:19.083 --> 00:06:20.583
Chelsea has so much money to burn,

00:06:20.583 --> 00:06:22.833
they bought me, like, all these cool new gadgets!

00:06:26.958 --> 00:06:27.583
Haha!

00:06:30.083 --> 00:06:32.458
-Alright lads, everybody on the coach!

00:06:32.833 --> 00:06:35.583
-Spy! Take the mask off!
-Get off me!

00:06:35.583 --> 00:06:36.958
-What did you do with Frank?!

00:06:36.958 --> 00:06:37.583
-Stop it!

00:06:48.208 --> 00:06:50.083
Oh, that is you. Hey, Frank!

00:06:50.958 --> 00:06:55.458
-I fear Christian’s taken the spy bit a bit too far.

00:06:55.458 --> 00:06:58.458
If I’m to get him back onside, I’ll have to call in the big guns.

00:07:01.333 --> 00:07:04.208
Hello, Jose. No, sorry, no time to talk right now.

00:07:04.208 --> 00:07:07.583
Um, may I have Zlatan's number, please?

00:07:09.333 --> 00:07:10.333
-Yeah, boy.

00:07:10.958 --> 00:07:14.083
Pulisic. Christian, Pulisic.

00:07:14.583 --> 00:07:15.083
Huh?

00:07:18.583 --> 00:07:19.833
Zlatan?

00:07:21.083 --> 00:07:22.458
(Gasp) Ibrahimovic!!!

00:07:25.458 --> 00:07:27.958
Oh my god, oh my god, oh my god!

00:07:33.708 --> 00:07:37.333
Zlatan! I got your note about the secret mission!

00:07:37.333 --> 00:07:38.833
-Shhh. Be cool, be cool.

00:07:38.833 --> 00:07:41.458
Ok, here is the stupid backstory:

00:07:41.458 --> 00:07:45.833
Someone is kidnapping footballers and turning them into...

00:07:45.833 --> 00:07:47.958
human trophies!!

00:07:48.583 --> 00:07:49.333
-(Gasp) Oh my god.

00:07:49.708 --> 00:07:50.958
-There he is! Grab him!

00:07:50.958 --> 00:07:52.708
-I've said too much! Run!

00:07:53.958 --> 00:07:55.958
-Hey! Leave him alone!

00:07:55.958 --> 00:07:57.833
We were in the middle of a conversation!

00:07:58.708 --> 00:08:00.833
-Ooo, fresh meat!

00:08:01.458 --> 00:08:03.958
-How bout a taste of this Hershey CHOPlet!

00:08:05.583 --> 00:08:07.458
-Don't bother following us, Christian.

00:08:07.458 --> 00:08:08.833
You'll never find us at our evil lair

00:08:08.833 --> 00:08:10.958
located on Roman Abramovich's yacht,

00:08:10.958 --> 00:08:15.208
which is the only boat in the harbor, 100 meters that way.

00:08:15.833 --> 00:08:17.708
-Dang it, they got away!

00:08:18.333 --> 00:08:22.083
Gosh. Now I’ll never find their evil lair.

00:08:22.083 --> 00:08:25.333
Hmmm, where could it possibly be?

00:08:25.958 --> 00:08:27.958
-The boat! They’re on the boat, man.

00:08:28.583 --> 00:08:30.083
-I bet they’re on the boat.

00:08:37.833 --> 00:08:39.208
-(Yelling)

00:08:45.208 --> 00:08:47.333
Oh wow, the Zlatan statue.

00:08:47.333 --> 00:08:48.458
They must have fixed it.

00:08:49.333 --> 00:08:50.833
Nose is a little small, though.

00:08:50.833 --> 00:08:52.708
-No, I've been turned into a trophy, you idiot!

00:08:52.708 --> 00:08:54.708
-Shh, trophies don't talk.

00:08:55.208 --> 00:08:56.583
-(Laughing)

00:08:57.458 --> 00:08:59.458
-Congratulations, ding-dong.

00:08:59.458 --> 00:09:00.208
You found me.

00:09:00.208 --> 00:09:01.708
-Sergio Ramos?!

00:09:01.708 --> 00:09:02.833
-Who else?

00:09:02.833 --> 00:09:04.708
No, seriously, who else would be the bad guy?

00:09:04.708 --> 00:09:06.208
-I'm gonna stop you!

00:09:06.208 --> 00:09:08.083
-Well, you can either stop me

00:09:08.083 --> 00:09:10.333
or save your friends!

00:09:10.958 --> 00:09:12.083
-Please, save us.

00:09:12.083 --> 00:09:13.708
-Yes, we are so scared.

00:09:14.083 --> 00:09:16.208
-The choice is yours, Mr. Pulisic!

00:09:18.583 --> 00:09:23.208
-Hmmm. My friends? Or Sergio Ramos?

00:09:23.708 --> 00:09:30.208
My friends? Or Sergio Ramos?

00:09:30.208 --> 00:09:31.458
My friend-

00:09:31.458 --> 00:09:33.708
-Bruv! You can do both, just get a move on.

00:09:33.708 --> 00:09:34.333
-Right!

00:09:34.833 --> 00:09:36.458
Hang in there, chaps.

00:09:36.458 --> 00:09:37.333
I'll get you down!

00:09:37.333 --> 00:09:38.083
-Wait, don't-

00:09:40.583 --> 00:09:42.958
-Gee. Thanks, Christian. You saved us.

00:09:42.958 --> 00:09:44.833
-Hasta la vista, baby!

00:09:47.583 --> 00:09:48.958
Your Majesty?

00:09:49.208 --> 00:09:52.208
-Oh, gasp! Save me, Mr. Pulisic!

00:09:52.208 --> 00:09:54.833
-Let the Queen go, Sergio Ramos!

00:09:54.833 --> 00:09:55.583
-(Shouting)

00:09:55.583 --> 00:09:57.833
-Alright, alright! I'm going, jeez.

00:09:57.833 --> 00:09:59.083
What an overreaction, this guy.

00:09:59.583 --> 00:10:02.083
-Oh! Thank you, Agent 10.

00:10:02.083 --> 00:10:04.333
You really gave it 110 percent.

00:10:04.333 --> 00:10:06.708
Terrific, a proper spy job.

00:10:06.708 --> 00:10:10.333
But that must have been very stressful and overwhelming.

00:10:10.333 --> 00:10:11.208
Hmmm?

00:10:11.208 --> 00:10:14.333
Enough to make you never want to be a spy again?

00:10:14.833 --> 00:10:17.208
-Are you kidding? I'm just getting started.

00:10:17.208 --> 00:10:18.333
C'mon, give me another mission!

00:10:18.333 --> 00:10:18.958
Give me another mission!

00:10:18.958 --> 00:10:21.208
Anything! Anything!

00:10:21.208 --> 00:10:23.833
-I now realize my lie has sent Christian

00:10:23.833 --> 00:10:26.208
down a dangerous path of self-delusion.

00:10:26.833 --> 00:10:29.333
Welp, there's only one way to sort this:

00:10:29.333 --> 00:10:30.833
with an even bigger lie.

00:10:30.833 --> 00:10:33.083
Alright, one more mission.

00:10:33.083 --> 00:10:37.333
I need you to go undercover as a Chelsea footballer.

00:10:37.333 --> 00:10:40.583
So deep under cover that you'll never speak

00:10:40.583 --> 00:10:43.458
of being a spy ever again.

00:10:43.458 --> 00:10:44.833
Ever. Got it?

00:10:46.708 --> 00:10:49.583
-Oohhh that is so smart!

00:10:49.583 --> 00:10:51.958
I mean, I don't get it at all,

00:10:51.958 --> 00:10:53.833
but it sounds really smart.

00:10:54.708 --> 00:10:57.083
-There must've been an easier way to do this.

00:11:00.083 --> 00:11:02.583
-Last one to training’s a rotten egg!

00:11:03.083 --> 00:11:04.708
-Hope there’s no lasers in there!

00:11:05.333 --> 00:11:06.333
Right?

00:11:06.333 --> 00:11:07.333
Please, Christian.

00:11:07.583 --> 00:11:10.458
-Ha! Don't worry, that's all behind me.

00:11:10.458 --> 00:11:14.083
I'm just a regular ole football player guy now.

00:11:14.083 --> 00:11:15.208
-Splendid!

00:11:18.708 --> 00:11:20.583
-Good show, Agent Pulisic.

00:11:20.583 --> 00:11:22.583
You’ve made Britain proud.

00:11:22.583 --> 00:11:24.708
And Frank doesn't suspect a thing.

00:11:24.708 --> 00:11:27.708
-And he never will.

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:38.541
What happens when 800 of the world's most elite footballers

00:11:38.541 --> 00:11:41.541
and their managers live together under one roof?

00:11:41.541 --> 00:11:43.250
Players stop being polite

00:11:43.250 --> 00:11:45.500
and start getting Re-al.

00:11:45.500 --> 00:11:46.250
This is

00:11:46.250 --> 00:11:47.291
The Champions.

00:11:47.291 --> 00:11:50.000
-People say all I do is score penalties…

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:52.875
but I also dive to win those penalties.

00:11:52.875 --> 00:11:56.250
-Oh, yeah! First American to wear the Barca jersey!

00:11:56.250 --> 00:11:58.125
America!

00:11:58.125 --> 00:12:00.791
-You think it’s so easy for Bayern to win the league?

00:12:00.791 --> 00:12:03.000
It takes a lot of careful planning

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:05.500
to buy all the best players from all the other teams.

00:12:05.500 --> 00:12:09.541
-When the weather gets colder, it’s a good time to reconsider Florida.

00:12:09.541 --> 00:12:11.375
We’ve got loads of hot spots.

00:12:11.375 --> 00:12:13.500
(Coughs)

00:12:21.000 --> 00:12:22.000
-Hurry up, mate!

00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:23.625
The ladies will be here any minute.

00:12:24.541 --> 00:12:26.416
-Hello, lads, we brought you some lunch.

00:12:26.416 --> 00:12:27.125
(Gasps)

00:12:27.125 --> 00:12:28.625
What you doing?!

00:12:28.625 --> 00:12:31.000
-Relax, bruv, we’re diggin’ a contraband tunnel.

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:34.375
-Jadon, if you want to play for Manchester United one day

00:12:34.375 --> 00:12:36.625
you can't be breaking the rules all willy-nilly.

00:12:36.625 --> 00:12:38.000
That’s how you end up slippin’.

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:39.416
- Slip on this.

00:12:39.416 --> 00:12:40.666
(Farts)

00:12:40.666 --> 00:12:41.750
-Eww, that's a stinker.

00:12:41.750 --> 00:12:42.500
-(Laughing)

00:12:42.500 --> 00:12:44.750
-That’s it. You need to learn some respect.

00:12:44.750 --> 00:12:46.791
Right now you have it pretty good at the mansion,

00:12:46.791 --> 00:12:50.000
but you never know what next season brings.

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:52.375
Time you see how the other half lives…

00:12:52.375 --> 00:12:54.916
on a tour of Europa House.

00:12:54.916 --> 00:12:56.416
-No! I can’t go back!

00:12:56.416 --> 00:12:57.416
You can’t make me!

00:13:11.041 --> 00:13:13.625
-Have a good ebening.

00:13:14.750 --> 00:13:16.500
-Hello? Anyone here?

00:13:17.625 --> 00:13:19.250
-Here's Vardy!

00:13:19.250 --> 00:13:21.000
-Oi! Do not sneak up on people like that!

00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:23.125
-Welcome to Europa House.

00:13:23.125 --> 00:13:26.250
Sorry about the exploding light bulbs...

00:13:26.250 --> 00:13:27.750
They're incandescent!

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:31.875
As a former juvenile delinquent,

00:13:31.875 --> 00:13:33.750
I’ve developed a process for getting through

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:36.125
to young players and settin’ ‘em straight.

00:13:36.125 --> 00:13:37.875
I just scare the s--t out of them.

00:13:37.875 --> 00:13:41.000
Right this way, up-and-coming talents!

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:45.500
Let me be your ghoulish guide through this house of Meh.

00:13:45.500 --> 00:13:49.375
We start every day here with a free breakfast buffet.

00:13:49.375 --> 00:13:50.250
-Oh, that's not so bad.

00:13:50.250 --> 00:13:51.916
-But it's also not so good,

00:13:51.916 --> 00:13:53.250
because there's no eggs.

00:13:53.250 --> 00:13:56.000
-(Yelling)
-Where do they get their protein?

00:13:56.000 --> 00:14:00.250
-Here we have our all-inclusive community fitness center.

00:14:00.250 --> 00:14:00.791
-Oh, nice.

00:14:00.791 --> 00:14:02.666
-But it's just one elliptical!

00:14:02.666 --> 00:14:03.250
-(Gasps)

00:14:03.250 --> 00:14:04.750
-That’s not how you’re supposed to use that!

00:14:04.750 --> 00:14:09.000
-Want to take a dip in our Stadio Olimpico-sized swimming pool?

00:14:09.000 --> 00:14:11.125
Well, too bad, because there’s no towels!

00:14:11.125 --> 00:14:11.750
-(Yelling)

00:14:11.750 --> 00:14:13.875
-Oh, no, they’re cold!

00:14:13.875 --> 00:14:15.750
-Check this out!

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:17.500
-(Shouting)
-(Screaming)

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:19.416
-Bloody hell!
-What happened to those guys?!

00:14:19.416 --> 00:14:21.750
-Oh. Nothing, that's just their away kits.

00:14:21.750 --> 00:14:24.250
I was tryna show you how small the rooms is.

00:14:30.416 --> 00:14:31.125
-(Gasps)

00:14:31.750 --> 00:14:34.000
-I don’t like it here. It’s scary.

00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:36.166
-Pshhh. What’s scary? This guy?

00:14:36.166 --> 00:14:38.250
Scariest thing about him is his caffeine addiction.

00:14:38.250 --> 00:14:39.375
(Laughing)

00:14:39.375 --> 00:14:42.541
-I'm sorry, you think I'm funny? I'm funny how?

00:14:42.541 --> 00:14:44.166
I mean, funny like a clown?

00:14:44.166 --> 00:14:46.791
I'm not a clown. This guy's a clown.

00:14:46.791 --> 00:14:49.666
-I do birthday parties, Bar and Bat Mitzvahs,

00:14:49.666 --> 00:14:52.250
Quinceaneras, and I've even done some football games.

00:14:52.625 --> 00:14:55.500
-Look, mate, you can’t scare me, so stop trying.

00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:56.750
It's just embarrassing.

00:14:56.750 --> 00:14:58.750
-Oh, you don't think I'm scary?

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:03.375
Alright, then, I'll show you something scary.

00:15:06.500 --> 00:15:08.375
-What is this place?

00:15:08.375 --> 00:15:10.291
-It's a sauna...

00:15:10.291 --> 00:15:11.541
But it never gets hot!

00:15:11.916 --> 00:15:14.125
Go ahead, take a look-see.

00:15:15.750 --> 00:15:16.750
-(Hissing)

00:15:16.750 --> 00:15:17.541
-F--k me,

00:15:17.541 --> 00:15:18.750
what was that?

00:15:18.750 --> 00:15:24.250
-Anyone fancy a loan to Leicester?

00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:26.000
-You know what...
-Oh, hell no
-I'm out

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:27.375
-Hell no
-I must not
-No, thank you

00:15:27.375 --> 00:15:30.750
-Behold. My envelope of doom

00:15:30.750 --> 00:15:33.875
shall reveal your fate.

00:15:33.875 --> 00:15:36.875
Ah, Phil Foden. Hope of England,

00:15:36.875 --> 00:15:39.166
like so many talents before you.

00:15:39.166 --> 00:15:42.541
Till a little injury will become a persistent one.

00:15:42.541 --> 00:15:45.916
And before you know it, your contract is up for renegotiation,

00:15:45.916 --> 00:15:48.375
and you find yourself smiling through the pain

00:15:48.375 --> 00:15:50.666
as you hold up a West Ham shirt.

00:15:51.166 --> 00:15:51.750
-No!

00:15:51.750 --> 00:15:54.000
I don’t like people blowing bubbles at me!

00:15:54.500 --> 00:15:55.875
-Ansu Fati.

00:15:55.875 --> 00:15:57.291
They call you the next Messi.

00:15:57.291 --> 00:16:00.500
But like Bojan before you, it all goes wrong.

00:16:00.500 --> 00:16:02.250
You ask for more playing time, but instead

00:16:02.250 --> 00:16:05.125
you’re sold to a Portuguese club with a buy-back clause.

00:16:05.125 --> 00:16:06.375
And you’re never bought back.

00:16:06.375 --> 00:16:07.041
-(Screaming)

00:16:07.041 --> 00:16:09.500
-OK, Brendan, I think that’s enough.

00:16:09.500 --> 00:16:10.750
They're just young lads.

00:16:10.750 --> 00:16:12.125
-And you,

00:16:12.125 --> 00:16:15.166
Jadon Sancho.

00:16:15.166 --> 00:16:20.000
Your fortune is just three letters long.

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:26.125
M... L... S...

00:16:26.541 --> 00:16:28.000
-No!
-(Laughing)

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:29.625
-(Laughing)
-Please, please
-I'll be good. I promise.

00:16:29.625 --> 00:16:31.250
-Call us an Uber back to the mansion,
-Oh, no!

00:16:31.250 --> 00:16:31.916
-I hate it here.

00:16:31.916 --> 00:16:33.375
-I said that's enough!

00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:37.541
-(Yelling)

00:16:37.541 --> 00:16:38.541
Mommy please!

00:16:42.250 --> 00:16:43.250
-Phew!

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:46.500
Thanks, mate. You really showed me I need to shape up,

00:16:46.500 --> 00:16:48.250
so I don’t end up like you.

00:16:48.250 --> 00:16:53.041
-Ah! Another successful role-modeling by Jamie Vardy.

00:16:53.041 --> 00:16:54.791
Bon voyage, lads!

00:16:54.791 --> 00:16:59.000
Don’t forget to write to your new mentor, Jamie Vardy.

00:16:59.000 --> 00:17:02.250
I’d come closer if it weren’t for me ankle bracelet!

00:17:11.250 --> 00:17:14.250
What happens when 800 of the world's most elite footballers

00:17:14.250 --> 00:17:17.000
and their managers live together under one roof?

00:17:17.000 --> 00:17:18.916
Players stop being polite

00:17:18.916 --> 00:17:21.125
and start getting Re-al.

00:17:21.125 --> 00:17:22.000
This is

00:17:22.000 --> 00:17:23.041
The Champions.

00:17:23.041 --> 00:17:27.166
-Things are really crazy at Barcelona right now.

00:17:27.166 --> 00:17:29.291
But I am not one to panic.

00:17:29.291 --> 00:17:30.875
-Hey, did you call me?

00:17:30.875 --> 00:17:33.000
-Every team needs an identity.

00:17:33.000 --> 00:17:37.166
Mine is “Premier League: Where Are They Now.”

00:17:37.166 --> 00:17:40.125
-People keep saying my problem is that I overthink things.

00:17:40.125 --> 00:17:41.416
But have they considered that

00:17:41.416 --> 00:17:42.875
they’re not thinking about things enough?

00:17:43.625 --> 00:17:47.375
-Mmm! England is so different from Germany.

00:17:47.375 --> 00:17:49.750
But at least the food is still bad!

00:18:02.375 --> 00:18:03.791
-C’mon, microchip,

00:18:03.791 --> 00:18:06.166
I know you’re in there somewhere.

00:18:06.166 --> 00:18:07.625
Ever since leaving Liverpool,

00:18:07.625 --> 00:18:09.125
people act like I just walked off

00:18:09.125 --> 00:18:10.750
the edge of the flat Earth.

00:18:10.750 --> 00:18:11.291
Ha!

00:18:11.291 --> 00:18:13.041
But I am still the best defender...

00:18:13.041 --> 00:18:14.000
of the truth.

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:15.750
You see that? The dome is fake.

00:18:15.750 --> 00:18:18.666
It’s a projection created by Bill Gates to control us.

00:18:18.666 --> 00:18:20.250
Exhibit A:

00:18:20.250 --> 00:18:22.000
Yah-hoo!

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:26.000
(Grunts)

00:18:26.000 --> 00:18:27.000
(Sniffs)

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:28.000
Oh.

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:29.125
What is this?

00:18:29.625 --> 00:18:32.541
A smell like a Dutch meadow full of tulips?

00:18:34.625 --> 00:18:35.416
(Sniffs)

00:18:35.416 --> 00:18:36.750
Oh yeah.
(Sniffs)

00:18:40.875 --> 00:18:42.166
Virgil?

00:18:42.166 --> 00:18:43.875
You're supposed to be injured.

00:18:48.416 --> 00:18:49.375
(Gasps)

00:18:49.375 --> 00:18:51.041
This is impossible.

00:18:51.041 --> 00:18:52.166
-Can I help you, Dejan?

00:18:52.166 --> 00:18:53.291
-Oh, I'm so sorry…

00:18:53.291 --> 00:18:55.916
I was, uhhh, looking for Mo Salah.

00:18:55.916 --> 00:18:57.000
I miss him so bad.

00:18:58.625 --> 00:18:59.500
-Cool.

00:18:59.500 --> 00:19:01.250
Anyways, good luck with that.

00:19:02.041 --> 00:19:04.625
-Hey, uh, you were running pretty fast in there, huh?

00:19:04.625 --> 00:19:06.000
-I guess.

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:08.375
I mean, I'm just rehabbing.

00:19:08.375 --> 00:19:10.750
-And you didn't even break a sweat.

00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:11.750
-I never do.

00:19:13.125 --> 00:19:14.125
-He can't be human.

00:19:14.125 --> 00:19:15.625
He sprints with a bad ACL,

00:19:15.625 --> 00:19:16.375
doesn't sweat

00:19:16.375 --> 00:19:18.291
and still smells like a springtime in Holland?

00:19:18.916 --> 00:19:20.750
There's something stinky going on.

00:19:20.750 --> 00:19:23.416
And I'm gonna stick my nose in it.

00:19:32.375 --> 00:19:35.500
-(Yelling)
-(Machines whirring)

00:19:54.875 --> 00:19:58.125
Now, this is a very good string map.

00:20:07.375 --> 00:20:08.375
(Gasps)

00:20:13.875 --> 00:20:15.375
Clones.

00:20:16.166 --> 00:20:18.666
-You shouldn't be here, Dejan.
-You shouldn't be here, Dejan.

00:20:18.666 --> 00:20:20.166
-You were transferred.
-You were transferred.

00:20:20.166 --> 00:20:24.250
-(Yelling)

00:20:25.291 --> 00:20:26.625
You guys,

00:20:26.625 --> 00:20:27.625
you're not gonna believe it!

00:20:27.625 --> 00:20:29.500
Virgil van Dijk is a clone!

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:31.041
And there's a whole army of clones

00:20:31.041 --> 00:20:32.791
in a secret Liverpool laboratory!

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:34.375
-A Livertory?

00:20:34.375 --> 00:20:35.666
-Or is it like a Laborapool?

00:20:35.666 --> 00:20:37.291
-Oh, come on, guys.

00:20:37.291 --> 00:20:38.416
This is just another one of his

00:20:38.416 --> 00:20:40.291
coo-coo-wackadoo theories.

00:20:40.291 --> 00:20:43.000
-It's true! I can prove it!

00:20:43.000 --> 00:20:45.125
-It’s always something with this guy.

00:20:45.125 --> 00:20:46.125
First he said there’s a secret

00:20:46.125 --> 00:20:47.541
fight club in the basement,

00:20:47.541 --> 00:20:50.125
then Gareth Bale’s an alien, and now this?!

00:20:50.750 --> 00:20:53.041
You are a liar, and nobody believes you.

00:20:53.041 --> 00:20:54.541
And even if we did believe you,

00:20:54.541 --> 00:20:56.250
nobody has a VHS player.

00:20:56.250 --> 00:20:57.125
-He has a point.

00:20:57.125 --> 00:20:58.500
-Right on point, Malcom is.
-Right.
-Yes, yes.

00:20:58.500 --> 00:21:00.875
-Who has time to rewind things these days?
-Very right. Yes.

00:21:00.875 --> 00:21:02.416
-Sorry, Dejan.

00:21:02.416 --> 00:21:05.875
But maybe it's time to find a new hobby.

00:21:05.875 --> 00:21:06.875
And a new hat.

00:21:07.875 --> 00:21:09.250
-If I want to convince these guys,

00:21:09.250 --> 00:21:11.250
I will need some hard evidence.

00:21:12.416 --> 00:21:13.416
-(Glass breaks)

00:21:14.875 --> 00:21:16.041
-This will do.

00:21:16.041 --> 00:21:18.916
-That doesn't belong to you, Dejan.
-That doesn't belong to you, Dejan.

00:21:18.916 --> 00:21:20.500
-Get back! I’ll expose you!

00:21:20.500 --> 00:21:22.500
I’ll tell the whole world what you’re doing here!

00:21:22.750 --> 00:21:24.791
-You shouldn’t have said that.
-You shouldn’t have said that.

00:21:24.791 --> 00:21:26.666
-Now, we can’t let you leave.
-Now, we can’t let you leave.

00:21:27.166 --> 00:21:27.875
-Flank him.
-Flank him.

00:21:29.875 --> 00:21:32.000
(Chanting)
-You’ll never walk alone.
-You’ll never walk alone.

00:21:32.000 --> 00:21:35.166
(Group chanting)
-You’ll never walk alone.

00:21:35.166 --> 00:21:36.916
-Wait, I didn’t mean it. I saw nothing!
-(Chanting)

00:21:36.916 --> 00:21:38.625
-C’mon, who am I going to tell?!
-(Chanting)

00:21:38.625 --> 00:21:40.041
-Nobody believes me anyway, right?
-(Chanting)

00:21:40.041 --> 00:21:40.750
-(Chanting)
-OK.

00:21:40.750 --> 00:21:42.125
-OK, I’ll never stick my nose
-(Chanting)

00:21:42.125 --> 00:21:43.125
where it doesn’t belong again!
-(Chanting)

00:21:43.125 --> 00:21:44.625
-Please! I didn't mean it!
-(Chanting)

00:21:44.625 --> 00:21:47.541
-No!

00:21:49.375 --> 00:21:51.416
-(Chewing)

00:21:51.416 --> 00:21:55.500
-Woah, the eggs here are so good.

00:21:55.500 --> 00:21:57.125
-Hello, comrades. It's me.

00:21:57.125 --> 00:21:58.000
Dejan Lovren.

00:21:58.000 --> 00:21:59.000
The Zenit Saint Petersburg

00:21:59.000 --> 00:22:00.375
centre-back No. 6!

00:22:00.375 --> 00:22:01.541
After a good night's sleep,

00:22:01.541 --> 00:22:02.166
I now realize

00:22:02.166 --> 00:22:04.000
there's no such thing as clones.

00:22:04.000 --> 00:22:06.000
Anyways, enjoy your day!

00:22:08.500 --> 00:22:10.625
-Uh… Did anyone else notice

00:22:10.625 --> 00:22:12.416
Lovren has no belly button?

00:22:12.416 --> 00:22:13.625
-Yeah.

00:22:13.625 --> 00:22:14.875
He's a weirdo.

00:22:18.875 --> 00:22:21.291
Cleaning up after everyone is exhausting.

00:22:21.291 --> 00:22:23.166
I really need a holiday.

00:22:23.166 --> 00:22:24.625
When booking my trip,

00:22:24.625 --> 00:22:25.791
I sometimes wonder...

00:22:25.791 --> 00:22:28.541
What else could possibly go wrong?

00:22:32.125 --> 00:22:34.666
I mean, that probably won't happen.

00:22:34.666 --> 00:22:36.041
But if my plans have to change,

00:22:36.041 --> 00:22:36.666
it doesn't matter.

00:22:36.666 --> 00:22:39.500
Because Hotels.com has flexible booking options.

00:22:39.500 --> 00:22:43.625
Hotels.com. Because just in case.

00:22:47.750 --> 00:22:50.750
What happens when 800 of the world's most elite footballers

00:22:50.750 --> 00:22:53.791
and their managers live together under one roof?

00:22:53.791 --> 00:22:55.375
Players stop being polite

00:22:55.375 --> 00:22:57.625
and start getting Re-al.

00:22:57.625 --> 00:22:58.375
This is

00:22:58.375 --> 00:22:59.625
The Champions.

00:22:59.625 --> 00:23:00.541
-Watch out!

00:23:00.541 --> 00:23:03.041
Santa Klopp is coming to town!

00:23:03.041 --> 00:23:06.500
-I like my candy canes Harry.

00:23:07.000 --> 00:23:11.291
-Hmmm. I suppose I should ask Santa for a real passport.

00:23:11.666 --> 00:23:14.375
-What gift can you give a man who has it all?

00:23:14.375 --> 00:23:16.000
-Uh, humility?

00:23:16.000 --> 00:23:18.541
-Oh, how much is that? I’ll buy 100 humilities.

00:23:39.416 --> 00:23:42.125
-It’s a holly jolly lolly golly Christmas Day!
-Ding dong ding dong

00:23:42.125 --> 00:23:43.875
-Fa la la la la la la la!
-Ding dong ding dong

00:23:43.875 --> 00:23:46.750
-Shoo! Shoo! Get out of here, Europa House urchins!

00:23:46.750 --> 00:23:47.750
Ew.

00:23:48.375 --> 00:23:49.750
Ooo, ooh.

00:23:51.041 --> 00:23:53.375
I love Cristiano-mas.

00:23:53.375 --> 00:23:55.416
It's a time to put aside our differences

00:23:55.416 --> 00:23:57.541
and receive expensive gifts.

00:23:58.125 --> 00:24:01.625
Oooo! What is this? It's a squishy trophy.

00:24:01.625 --> 00:24:02.625
Is it, uh,

00:24:02.625 --> 00:24:03.291
(sniffs)

00:24:03.291 --> 00:24:05.041
is it supposed to smell like this?

00:24:05.041 --> 00:24:08.750
-All right, all right, this one is for you, Robert.

00:24:08.750 --> 00:24:11.291
-Oh cool, my dudes, you should not have!

00:24:11.291 --> 00:24:15.125
Wow, it’s so big! It must be a-

00:24:15.125 --> 00:24:17.166
a Ballon d'Or?

00:24:17.166 --> 00:24:19.500
-Well, we figured you deserved it this year anyway and-

00:24:19.500 --> 00:24:21.250
-Oh, wait wait wait. Hold on, hold on.

00:24:21.250 --> 00:24:23.625
Who are you to just give someone the Ballon d'Or?

00:24:24.125 --> 00:24:27.041
-I mean, he was the top scorer in the Bundesliga

00:24:27.041 --> 00:24:28.541
and the Champions League this year

00:24:28.541 --> 00:24:30.625
and Bayern won the treble so-

00:24:30.625 --> 00:24:33.750
-OK, well if we're all just giving the awards to our teammates,

00:24:33.750 --> 00:24:37.416
uh, Ronaldo! For, uh, having the most Instagram followers,

00:24:37.416 --> 00:24:39.291
you get the Ballon d'Or. Here.

00:24:39.291 --> 00:24:40.875
-No! Messi gets the Ballon d'Or

00:24:40.875 --> 00:24:42.250
for putting up with Bartomeu.

00:24:42.250 --> 00:24:42.791
-(Grunting)

00:24:42.791 --> 00:24:44.250
-Give me that.
-Give it back you-

00:24:44.250 --> 00:24:46.291
-Well, if we’re giving out the Ballon d'Or,

00:24:46.291 --> 00:24:48.750
I want the Lev Yashin Award for best goalkeeper!

00:24:48.750 --> 00:24:50.125
-Oh, like you would win!

00:24:50.125 --> 00:24:51.375
-I want a Grammy!

00:24:51.375 --> 00:24:52.916
-I want the Nobel Peace Prize, man!

00:24:53.500 --> 00:24:55.625
-Oh, fart you!
-(Shouting)

00:24:55.625 --> 00:24:57.750
-(Whistle blow)

00:24:57.750 --> 00:24:59.916
-Here’s how we will settle this.

00:24:59.916 --> 00:25:02.625
We will all get dressed up and gather in the auditorium

00:25:02.625 --> 00:25:04.625
and I will host this year's Ballon d’Or.

00:25:04.625 --> 00:25:07.875
It will be a very tasteful ceremony

00:25:07.875 --> 00:25:11.250
as long as everybody follows my rules.

00:25:11.250 --> 00:25:13.000
OK?

00:25:18.000 --> 00:25:20.375
Here are the rules!

00:25:20.375 --> 00:25:21.791
Nine men enter!

00:25:21.791 --> 00:25:23.000
One man leaves!

00:25:25.041 --> 00:25:25.666
BEGIN!

00:25:25.666 --> 00:25:30.250
-(Shouting)

00:25:30.250 --> 00:25:32.250
-Who run Barca-town?!

00:25:32.250 --> 00:25:33.041
-Wait. I don't get it,

00:25:33.041 --> 00:25:34.000
what are the teams?

00:25:34.000 --> 00:25:35.500
-I am very confused!

00:25:36.041 --> 00:25:38.375
-Should half of us take our shirts off or something?

00:25:38.375 --> 00:25:40.541
-Why did you call it Beyond Ballon D'ome

00:25:40.541 --> 00:25:42.250
when all the important stuff happens

00:25:42.250 --> 00:25:44.000
inside the Ballon D'ome?

00:25:44.375 --> 00:25:46.125
-Yeah, I guess I got carried away

00:25:46.125 --> 00:25:47.875
with all the cool costumes and production design

00:25:47.875 --> 00:25:50.416
and didn’t really think the rest of this concept through.

00:25:50.416 --> 00:25:52.125
OK, OK, new rules.

00:25:52.125 --> 00:25:53.166
How 'bout this:

00:25:53.166 --> 00:25:55.416
Four men enter.

00:25:55.416 --> 00:25:56.791
Two men leave.

00:25:56.791 --> 00:25:58.250
Those men advance to the knockout round.

00:25:58.250 --> 00:26:00.416
We do this eight times.

00:26:00.416 --> 00:26:01.416
Then we take those 16 men

00:26:01.416 --> 00:26:03.291
and put their names in a pot-

00:26:03.291 --> 00:26:04.791
-Hey look! It's snowing!

00:26:06.125 --> 00:26:08.000
-Woah, snowflakes.
-Snow.

00:26:08.000 --> 00:26:10.041
-Oh, it makes me so happy.

00:26:10.041 --> 00:26:11.125
I love the snow.

00:26:11.125 --> 00:26:12.125
